# star_wars_le 1.30 - worked out by the app from the ports of The Beatles 1.29, Deadpool LE 1.14, Deadpool Pro 1.16, Godzilla Premium/LE 1.16, Godzilla Pro 1.15, Jaws LE 1.02, TMNT Pro 1.59.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 40 of its 42 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 8 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane.
# program sha1 ddbf86a53a4420b53910f2f604753513b10c58b5, portgen revision 3, 7 reference port(s) of framework generation B.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): countdown, ten_seconds.

